<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>LessGooo | DevOps Zero to Hero</title>

    <style>

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: white;
        }

        header {
            background: #111827;
            padding: 20px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            color: #38bdf8;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero span {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .hero p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .button {
            background: #38bdf8;
            color: #0f172a;
            padding: 14px 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .section {
            padding: 60px 8%;
        }

        .section h2 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            font-size: 32px;
        }

        .courses {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #1e293b;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            background: #334155;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .card a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: #38bdf8;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            background: #111827;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        @media(max-width: 700px) {

            header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 20px;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 8px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 34px;
            }

        }

    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

    <div class="logo">LessGooo 🚀</div>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#courses">Courses</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
    </nav>

</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">

    <h1>Become a <span>DevOps Engineer</span></h1>

    <p>
        Learn DevOps from Zero to Hero.
        Practice real-world skills and build your future.
    </p>

    <a href="#courses" class="button">
        Start Learning
    </a>

</section>

<section class="section" id="courses">

    <h2>Explore Learning Paths</h2>

    <div class="courses">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🐧 Linux</h3>
            <p>
                Learn Linux commands, file systems,
                permissions, users and shell scripting.
            </p>
            <a href="#">Explore Linux →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🌐 Git & GitHub</h3>
            <p>
                Learn version control, repositories,
                branching, merging and pull requests.
            </p>
            <a href="#">Explore Git →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🐳 Docker</h3>
            <p>
                Learn containers, images, volumes,
                networks and Docker Compose.
            </p>
            <a href="#">Explore Docker →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>☁️ AWS</h3>
            <p>
                Learn cloud computing, EC2, S3,
                IAM, VPC and deployment.
            </p>
            <a href="#">Explore AWS →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🔷 Microsoft Azure</h3>
            <p>
                Learn Azure Virtual Machines,
                networking, storage and administration.
            </p>
            <a href="#">Explore Azure →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🏗️ Terraform</h3>
            <p>
                Learn Infrastructure as Code,
                providers, resources and modules.
            </p>
            <a href="#">Explore Terraform →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>⚙️ CI/CD</h3>
            <p>
                Learn automation, pipelines,
                GitHub Actions and deployment.
            </p>
            <a href="#">Explore CI/CD →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>☸️ Kubernetes</h3>
            <p>
                Learn container orchestration,
                pods, deployments and services.
            </p>
            <a href="#">Explore Kubernetes →</a>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section class="section" id="about">

    <h2>About LessGooo</h2>

    <p style="text-align:center; color:#cbd5e1; line-height:1.8;">

        LessGooo is a learning platform designed to help
        beginners become skilled DevOps engineers.

        Learn, practice, build and grow.

    </p>

</section>

<footer>

    <p>LessGooo © 2026 | Learn. Practice. Build. 🚀</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
